%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: A9_5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: 'The incident i mentioned was a huge disaster. There were stars raining
      down on us. They destroyed everything and killed everyone. I was also very
      injured because a big one of them fell onto our house and a fragment of that
      star then fell directly into my eye. '
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "That\u2019s crazy."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I\u2019m really sorry that happened to you."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He just nods and squeezes my hand tighter.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I\u2019m the only one that survived a hit because I managed to fuse with
      the star fragment and gain my power through it. And since then I have the golden
      parts in my eyes and hair."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I look at Aleph closely and focus at the parts that he mentioned.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "It\u2019s true, I noticed the tips of his hair being blonde before, but
      I never knew there was such a story behind it."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "And now that I\u2019m looking more closely, I notice that they aren\u2019t
      just blonde, they have a golden shine to them."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "And his eyes as well, I thought it was just heterochromia. But it\u2019s
      all because he fused with that star fragment, huh."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: When was that?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: A long time ago. I was five back then. But the star gave me more willpower
      and strength as well it seems, because I managed to build everything up again
      and rule over the kingdom until I reached my twenties.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "And that\u2019s when you were zapped into my dimension?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yeah almost. There was something strange though. At that time, I was stargazing
      through my window one night.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Then I saw a shooting star. I thought it was about to rain fire again but
      instead a bright light engulfed everything and when I came to, I was in the
      living room with my parents and it was like the disaster never even happened.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: So you travelled back in time? Did you get to relive your past?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "No, I didn\u2019t go back to five years old. It felt just like it was
      a parallel universe where the incident never happened. I also didn\u2019t have
      my power and the golden eyes and hair anymore. I was happy but that lasted
      only for a short while."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Because the incident happened again. Just a lot later than in the first
      timeline. I tried saving everyone but I had no powers and then I blacked out
      and woke up in your dimension. But right now I think we are in the timeline
      where everyone died.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "That\u2019s really horrible. It must have been hell for him."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "So you were looking for your parents earlier. That\u2019s unfortunate."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "That makes me so sad for him. He was hoping to find his family alive and
      well but now they\u2019re gone."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: We sit down on the bed and continue our conversation.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Well, I was thinking maybe we can find a way into the second timeline and
      save everyone?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Hmm, it\u2019s difficult. I understand that you want that to be the true
      timeline but I just can\u2019t imagine how we could do that."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I mean you have powers, we saw that because somehow, you brought us here.
      And I also have some, just not as powerful as yours. If we work together, maybe
      we can find a way.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He looks at me pleadingly and I almost immediately agree to his plan.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Let me think about that some more. I still have to find out how exactly
      I managed to bring us here. Right now, it\u2019s just a lot, you know?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Aleph nods with a sad expression.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 10
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I understand. That must have been information overload for you.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8021ae93b2207b94a95f0fd830781878, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I do feel bad but I need some time.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: How can I lift the mood a bit?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 96ec51593b93df042857171a2e8b311a, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3e8db5ca5e96fd04ead812b05bd7b847, type: 2}
